"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-037-wei"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p026","quote":"殤公秋立，封孫文子林父於宿。十二年，甯喜與孫林父爭寵相惡，殤公使甯喜攻孫林父。林父奔晉，復求入故衞獻公。獻公在齊，齊景公聞之，與衞獻公如晉求入。晉爲伐衞，誘與盟。衞殤公會晉平公，平公執殤公與甯喜而復入衞獻公。獻公亡在外十二年而入。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p027","quote":"獻公後元年，誅甯喜。三年，呉延陵季子使過衞，見蘧伯玉、史魚，曰：「衞多君子，其國無故。」過宿，孫林父爲撃磬，曰：「不樂，音大悲，使衞亂乃此矣。」是年，獻公卒，子襄公惡立。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與追稱、衛世系及具體事件暫定所列提及同指；每段原文附存，不按同名字面跨篇合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p026","text":"殤公秋立，封孫文子林父於宿。十二年，甯喜與孫林父爭寵相惡，殤公使甯喜攻孫林父。林父奔晉，復求入故衞獻公。獻公在齊，齊景公聞之，與衞獻公如晉求入。晉爲伐衞，誘與盟。衞殤公會晉平公，平公執殤公與甯喜而復入衞獻公。獻公亡在外十二年而入。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"殤公秋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001577","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0006","start":6,"end":11,"surface":"孫文子林父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001574","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"甯喜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001578","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"孫林父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001574","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"殤公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001577","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"甯喜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001578","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0035","start":35,"end":38,"surface":"孫林父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001574","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"林父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001574","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m026-0047","start":47,"end":51,"sur